WEBVTT

00:05:27.490 --> 00:05:30.493
It's time now to protect
the rights of unmarried people

00:05:30.534 --> 00:05:32.536
and other kinds of family constellations.

00:05:32.578 --> 00:05:36.707
(Applause)

00:05:36.707 --> 00:05:38.751
Because the reality is,
there's no evidence

00:05:38.751 --> 00:05:41.462
that the nuclear family model
is actually the best one.

00:05:42.338 --> 00:05:44.173
Research has consistently shown

00:05:44.215 --> 00:05:47.593
that children need stability
of parental figures.

00:05:48.177 --> 00:05:50.137
But from what I've consistently found,

00:05:50.179 --> 00:05:53.682
it doesn't matter
if that stability is mom and dad,

00:05:53.682 --> 00:05:55.684
two dads, mom and grandma

00:05:55.684 --> 00:05:57.478
or three polyamorous partners.

00:05:58.312 --> 00:06:00.606
So this is not only about justice.